@startuml
title Product Catalog Management - Step 2 - Product Offering creation

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

actor Marketer
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #purple
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM <<blackbox>>
participant "EventManager" as EventMgr #grey

Marketer -> EM : 50 marketer is connecting to catalog app
EM -> PCM : 51 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(WelcomeCatalog, marketer)
activate PCM
PCM --> EM : 52 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(List of available actions: Create ProductOffering, Manage ProductOffering\nRetrieve Notification, Create POP, Manage POP\nTest PO, Launch PO)

group Product Offering creation

    Marketer -> EM : 53 Need to create new product offering for 'Fiber Access'
    EM -> PCM : 54 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(Create ProductOffering, productOfferingType=atomicProductOffering)
    PCM --> EM : 55 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(process.id12, Provide support ProductSpecification taskFlow.id1)

    Marketer -> EM : 56 provide filters to retrieve product Specification
    EM -> PCM : 57 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management** GET /productSpecification\n(filters + state)
    PCM --> EM : 58 **TMF620** 200 OK\n(List of ProductSpecification)

    Marketer -> EM : 59 Pick a ProductSpecification (PS#56)
    EM -> PCM : 60 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/id12/taskFlow/id1\n(PS#56)
    PCM --> EM : 61 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(next task id2 Provide ProductOffering identity data)
    note over PCM : ProductOffering identity data are for example name, description, channel, market segment

    Marketer -> EM : 62 Provide name, ProductOffering identity data
    EM -> PCM : 63 **TMF701 ProcessFlow** PATCH /processFlow/id12/taskFlow/id2\n(ProductOffering identity data)
    PCM --> EM : 64 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(NextTasks: OperationSpecification, ProductOfferingTerm,\nAssociationToProductPrice, ValidateCreation,\nCancel)

    Marketer -> EM : 65 I need to check ProductSpecification operations
    EM -> PCM : 66 **TMF620 Product Catalog** GET /productOperation/id56
    PCM --> EM : 67 **TMF620** 200 OK\n(ProductOperation PS#56 representation)

    Marketer -> EM : 68 Provide OperationSpecification from ProductSpec PS#9
    EM -> PCM : 69 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/id12/taskFlow/id3\n(operationSpec/value)
    PCM -> PCM : 70 Check consistence with\nProductSpecification.operationSpec/value
    PCM --> EM : 71 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(process#, NextTasks: ProductOfferingTerm,\nAssociationToProductPrice, ValidateCreation, Cancel)

    note over PCM : Same for ProductOfferingTerm

    Marketer -> EM : 72 I valid this 'Fiber Access' ProductOffering creation
    EM -> PCM : 73 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow/id12/taskFlow/id4\n(ValidateCreation, true)

    PCM -> PCM : 74 **TMF620 Product Catalog**\nPOST /productOffering(all data, inDesign)\nas a result ProductOffering #569 is created

    PCM -> EventMgr : 75 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST /productOfferingCreateEvent\n(ProductOffering #569, state=inDesign)

    PCM --> EM : 76 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(process# completed, List of available actions:\nCreate ProductOffering, Manage ProductOffering\nRetrieve Notification, Create POP, Manage POP\nTest PO, Launch PO)
    deactivate PCM

end

@enduml
